{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉早上9時開始投票。截至下午3時，投票率95.6%，5458名選民投票。<br/>\n<br/>\n多個界別的投票率達到100%，包括商界（第一）、商界（第三）、香港僱主聯合會、工業界（第一）、會計界、法律界、科技創新界。<br/>\n<br/>\n投票率最低是保險界，有75%，66人已投票，界別選民人數有88人。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:43:50.929768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T07:18:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:37:25.612151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:37:25.800344+00:00","content_hash":"2cdbd77a04a88025ebc98882bfdae59e5a13f4170a9a35655c0110843797f018","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}